WEBVTT

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.380
Manju

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:09.380
Here you go!

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:11.000
A souvenir from our trip to the hot springs.

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.710
Thank you very much!

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:18.830
My apologies, but CHU2-sama is in the middle of
finalizing our staging setup at the moment.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.830
No problem! I'm the one who
dropped by without calling first.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.790
Isn't she incredible?

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.580
Composing, lyrics, staging... She does it all.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.420
Yes! That's CHU2-sama, for you.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:37.210
Well then, I'll hold on to CHU2-sama's souvenir
for the time being and pass it along later.

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:38.750
I appreciate it.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.460
Oh, and... Don't forget about our plans on the 7th.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.380
Right. But what sort of present should I bring?

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:50.670
Whatever you end up picking out,
I'm sure she'll love it!

00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:53.290
Got it!

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:58.920
Take care on your way home.

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:00.330
Have a good night!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.330
Good night.

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:10.630
LOCK-san left for the evening.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.290
Are you hungry at all?

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:19.130
Oh, what delicious-looking manju buns!

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:24.290
What business do my band members have
going on a vacation without me?

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.750
They hung out with Roselia and
Poppin' Party, instead.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.790
You were invited too, weren't you?

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.500
And to a fancy hot spring, no less.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:33.920
Like I said, I have no interest in a stupid bath!

00:01:33.920 --> 00:01:35.250
You dirty traitor!

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:36.790
What?!

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:40.790
I haven't gone anywhere! Did you hear me?!

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:45.580
CHU2-sama!

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.170
Please open the door, CHU2-sama!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:50.880
Where's my manju bun?!

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:54.920
Not bad...

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.880
Initial, I can't hide this passion in my heart

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:08.630
A sudden urge, and emotion flies from my fingertips!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:23.290
On that fateful day, I was neither a child nor an adult

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:28.290
Gazing unwaveringly at my dream and nothing else

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.330
Feelings overflowing in the night, flaring and flickering

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:38.380
I gathered my courage and set out on a journey

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:43.710
Initial, it came bubbling to the surface

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:48.500
My entire body shivering with emotion

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:53.380
Why do I keep staring up at the endless night sky

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:59.250
And crying out the same words over and over?

00:02:59.830 --> 00:03:03.130
Although I tend to get distracted

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.960
And sometimes caught up in a haze

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:10.420
The treasure is right before my very eyes

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:13.080
From that initial moment onwards

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.500
I've felt the pulsing of the stars

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:20.170
When you whip your fingers across the strings

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:23.170
Even now it makes my heart flutter

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:25.040
I love you!

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:29.790
Let's Go, PoPiPa

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.000
Live

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.000
Performing daily!

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.880
Live

00:03:38.170 --> 00:03:39.580
Thank you!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:44.380
We're performing here tomorrow
and the day after, so come see us again!

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.210
Poppin' Party MV (PoPi-V ♥) "Poppin' Shuffle"

00:03:44.920 --> 00:03:47.210
10332 Views

00:03:47.210 --> 00:03:49.330
We're getting more views again!

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:52.080
Performing "Poppin' Shuffle" was a good choice.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:53.250
The audience was pumped!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:55.580
Did you catch the old ladies sitting on the right?

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:57.040
Who do you think they're here to see?

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.080
Here's your answer.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:59.830
Look, this comment.

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:05.790
Hello, Happy Seniors Association

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:05.790
We watched this video when Hello, Happy World!

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:05.790
came to perform for us. It was very cute,

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:05.790
so we plan on attending one of their live shows.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.040
"Hello, Happy Seniors Association"?

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:05.540
A group of Hello Happy's elderly fans, most likely.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:10.130
Misaki mentioned once before that some of their
biggest fans live in the nursing homes.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:13.670
Seems like a bunch of people found us
through the PoPi-V.

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:18.040
They're leaving all kinds of comments. "I came here
because of PasuPare's video," stuff like that.

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.540
It's thanks to our friends for agreeing to help us out!

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:24.880
The final results are in, everyone!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:28.250
PoPiPa's performance at Galaxy earned... 100 votes!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:29.330
100 votes?!

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:32.920
Um, Galaxy's max capacity is 100 people, right?

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.130
A perfect score!

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:36.500
A perfect score? I've never gotten one before!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.750
Me, neither!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.920
Yay!

00:04:39.250 --> 00:04:41.460
It's time to hop aboard...

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.170
and ride this big wave!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:44.580
The wave's here?!

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.790
Right. And we can't let our momentum die out!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.380
Let's ride the wave!

00:04:48.380 --> 00:04:50.500
Yeah! But how, exactly?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:56.420
We're currently performing daily as part of our
"Three Weeks Live" concert series, right?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.330
Yeah.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.710
We'll add even more shows.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:04:59.500
What?!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.460
And perform somewhere even bigger!

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.500
WHAT?!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.170
How are we going to do that?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:09.830
With the preliminaries ending soon,
all of the venues are booked solid!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.920
After some research,
I found two venues with open slots.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.380
They have a much bigger capacity than Galaxy.

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:16.580
Which ones?

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:19.290
CiRCLE. And Dub, too.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.460
RAS' base of operations with
a max capacity of 1,000 people.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:27.540
I get it. Nobody wants to go
head-to-head against Roselia or RAS.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.630
Both formidable opponents, to be sure.

00:05:29.630 --> 00:05:32.500
And whether or not we manage
to score votes is a different story...

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.170
It would be tough, huh?

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.830
Especially at Dub.

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:38.920
They're sort of an exclusive venue in the first place...

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.500
You wanna perform at Dub?

00:05:43.460 --> 00:05:44.830
Massu?!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:52.500
Are we really doing this?

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:53.920
You think we shouldn't?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:56.290
I want to, but...

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.380
So nerve-wracking!

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.170
It's a message from Dub!

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.710
"Your entry has been accepted," they said...

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:07.380
Seriously?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.130
Dammit, MASKING...!

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:10.830
C'mon, where's the harm?

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:14.040
Been awfully boring with just us playin' there lately.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:15.290
You oughtta come.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.580
Yeah, well... Easier said than done.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:19.670
Done! Entry complete.

00:06:19.960 --> 00:06:22.130
They should be in touch with Saaya sometime soon.

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:23.250
Catch you there.

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.540
Since when did you two become friends...?

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:27.580
Man, I'm gettin' psyched up!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.540
Time to coordinate our plans, LOCK.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:34.290
PoPiPa...!

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:37.920
What do we do?

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:38.880
Let's go!

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.040
Not just to Dub. To CiRCLE, too!

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.580
Do you realize what's at stake here?!
There's a chance we could fall flat on our faces!

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:46.750
Yup, but it doesn't matter!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.580
Bring on the other venues!

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.920
Should we give it a shot?

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.380
Yeah, sounds good!

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:53.960
Let's throw down the gauntlet!

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.080
Won't that break it...?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.460
Good point...

00:06:56.460 --> 00:06:58.210
Let's place down the gauntlet!

00:06:58.210 --> 00:06:59.630
It's just a figure of speech...

00:06:59.630 --> 00:07:02.080
Why not? There's just over two weeks left...

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.250
This calls for some teamwork!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.330
I want to play at the Budokan!

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.170
We will.

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:15.040
And we'll bring everyone with us.
Oddie and Danjuro and my mom, too.

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:17.960
Fine...

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:25.000
This means accepting every single
opportunity that comes our way.

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:25.580
Right!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.880
Things are gonna get insanely tough.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:27.750
No problem!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:28.960
We'll work insanely hard!

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:30.380
I'm "insanely" excited!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:33.500
Then there's nothing else to say.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:36.210
I'm... shifting into beast mode!

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.630
Let's go, PoPiPa!

00:07:37.630 --> 00:07:39.420
Are you ready for the Budokan?!

00:07:39.420 --> 00:07:40.710
Yeah!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:42.290
Are you ready to crush this concert?!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:43.460
Yeah!

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:46.130
Are you ready to pass our final exams?!

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:47.330
Yeah!

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:48.460
Huh?

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:49.420
Huh?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.580
Answer me!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.290
O-of course!

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.000
Student Council Room

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.670
Try solving these.

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:58.630
Yes ma'am!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.960
Did you make that yourself?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:04.460
Yeah, as a study guide of sorts.

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:06.880
If they fail, we can kiss the Budokan goodbye.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:10.080
Remedial courses start around
the same time as the finals, don't they?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:14.330
On the bright side, having our exams right before
the preliminaries isn't necessarily a bad thing.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.460
How come?

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:18.330
Classes let out early during testing periods, right?

00:08:18.330 --> 00:08:20.500
We can pack our afternoons full of live shows.

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:23.170
It's the perfect setup
for performing twice in one day.

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.420
Arisa-chan, you're so smart!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.250
Perhaps, but our fate rests on their shoulders.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.500
Finished!

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.330
Good. Hand 'em over.

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.210
None of these are even close!

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.250
No lunch until you get it right!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.290
You monster!

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:45.920
PoPiPa, got a sec?

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:47.540
A concert?

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:48.830
Yeah.

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:52.670
As you know, we sometimes perform at
kindergartens and nursing homes.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:56.790
It seems the ladies there went to
one of your shows the other day.

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.540
They were hoping you'd consider playing at
the home and asked us to invite you.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:01.960
What do you think?

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:03.830
Sunday, eh?

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.420
We have shows at Galaxy that evening...

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:08.670
During the day, then!
First thing in the morning!

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:10.000
Good idea!

00:09:10.170 --> 00:09:13.580
Both the elderly and children love mornings!

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:14.920
I do, too!

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.170
But I love croquettes even more!

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.420
That's enough.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.580
No need to complicate the situation.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.000
Y-yeah...

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:23.250
Where'd they come from...?

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:27.080
Listen, I know we're the ones who
brought it up, but... Are you sure?

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.170
Aren't you busy with the preliminaries right now?

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.130
True... but I'd like to do it.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:34.750
Yeah! To show them our gratitude.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.750
Agreed.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:41.130
Concert

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:41.130
w/ Hello Happy

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.880
We're Poppin' Party!

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.880
Fall

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.880
Thanksgiving

00:09:41.130 --> 00:09:42.880
Festival

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:48.000
Is this anybody's first time here?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.080
Thanks a bunch!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.670
We hope you have tons of fun with us today!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.130
Thank you very much!

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:02.420
Good afternoon!

00:10:06.630 --> 00:10:08.790
Are you alright? Need water?

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.040
I'm okay. Thanks!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:14.080
We heard you've started playing
multiple shows a day.

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.630
Ah, youth!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:17.500
You're only a year older, aren't you?

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:21.250
Are you able to perform adequately
under those circumstances?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:23.420
Yes!

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:29.750
Don't you think Ichigaya-san and the others are cool?

00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:30.580
Yes.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:35.460
Yukina-san...?

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.080
Let's stay focused.

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.880
We can't allow ourselves to be beaten.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:42.040
Right!

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.460
Which reminds me, have you been
studying for your exams?

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.330
She ran away!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.710
The final results from CiRCLE are in.

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.960
What's the verdict?

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.330
Roselia received 472 votes...

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.540
votes

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.000
Of course...

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.670
Figured as much...

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:02.130
Impressive as always.

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.000
It looks like 28 people voted for us, though!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.250
votes

00:11:05.000 --> 00:11:06.250
You're right!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.920
Can you believe it?
A whole 28 people decided to cheer us on!

00:11:09.920 --> 00:11:11.330
I'm glad.

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.540
Tomorrow, we work hard to get
even more people cheering for us!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:17.130
Arisa-chan!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:18.880
Let's have a practice session tonight!

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:19.880
Huh?

00:11:19.880 --> 00:11:20.750
Bad idea?

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.790
It's just... We performed twice today, you know?

00:11:23.790 --> 00:11:25.040
Are you sure?

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:26.130
Totally sure!

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:30.750
Rimi-rin! You can count on me!

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.040
Me, too!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.960
I refuse to be beaten!

00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:46.880
SUCCESS

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:49.670
Sakura Village

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.630
Welcome to Hello, Happy World! & Poppin' Party

00:11:51.630 --> 00:11:52.920
Final Exams Start!!!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.630
Rimi-rin! Arisa!

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:03.210
If we don't catch the next train,
we won't make it in time!

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.790
Crap, I'm runnin' outta steam...

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.210
But... it's all aboard the wave!

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.040
All aboard the wave!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.790
Hey, my sisters!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.250
How are you on this fine day?

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:20.170
Hina-chan... Rii-chan!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:22.420
A car?! And what's with the sunglasses?!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.460
Seems like they're in a hurry.

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.710
Right, Debeko?

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:28.130
Okay, we'll chat later.

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:29.540
Hop in!

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:31.580
Where you headed?

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.790
To Dub!

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:44.540
Bold of you to come here, Poppin' Party.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.880
How foolish you must be,
playing right into our hands.

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.330
Like moths to a flame on a warm summer's eve!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.500
That's right.

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:53.290
Although it's already wintertime...

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:55.540
Nobody asked for your input!

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:58.250
Is this a comedy routine...?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.330
Stop that!

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:02.500
Fine, Poppin' Party.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.580
Prepare to be beaten to a pulp!

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.920
Again with the beatin'...?

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:08.670
Thank you very much!

00:13:11.630 --> 00:13:12.540
Yo!

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:14.380
Baked us some treats. Want a bite?

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:15.290
Ta-da!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:18.130
That's a lot of financiers!

00:13:18.790 --> 00:13:20.330
I also brought snacks to share.

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.670
They're a new item on the menu
at my family's bakery.

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:26.000
What a thoughtful gesture! Thank you very much!

00:13:26.460 --> 00:13:27.380
Hey.

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:30.420
I've been looking forward to you guys coming here.

00:13:30.420 --> 00:13:31.580
Me, too.

00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:36.040
Quit fraternizing with the enemy!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.710
Poppin' Party, you're up next.

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:39.580
Right!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.040
See you later!

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:48.500
(Dreamers go!)
(Dreamers go!)

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.250
Go Go Go! Tokimeke! Go! Dreamers!
Go, go, go! Get excited! Go! Dreamers!

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.960
Negaigoto o hiroiatsumete
Gather up all of your wishes

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:57.540
(Yume no) Uta o tsukurou!
(Make it) The song of your dreams!

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.170
Have they lost their minds?!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:14:02.170
Showing up at Dub and invading OUR territory...

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:05.000
Talk about crazy girls!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:08.080
They were only performing at Galaxy
up until recently, weren't they?

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:09.080
Guess so.

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:13.130
But they mentioned wanting to
perform here, so I invited 'em.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.580
Pretty awesome, don'tcha think?

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.960
I hear they've been playin' twice a day,

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:21.420
making the rounds at CiRCLE
and some of the other venues.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.750
They look like they're having fun.

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.420
CHU2-sama...?

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.080
Jerky refill.

00:14:30.460 --> 00:14:32.420
I wish we could watch up close!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.000
Then let's get out there.

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:35.330
You're comin' too, right?

00:14:35.330 --> 00:14:36.040
Huh?

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:37.380
What about you?

00:14:37.380 --> 00:14:38.380
I'm staying here.

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:39.380
Gotcha.

00:14:39.380 --> 00:14:41.000
Let's go, LOCK.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:42.710
'Kay.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:05.250
RAS blew us out of the water at Dub.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.710
Rock was incredible, wasn't she?!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.290
Some people DID end up voting for us, though.

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:14.380
A few say they plan on going to
our next concert at Galaxy.

00:15:14.380 --> 00:15:17.580
And the view count on our PoPi-V
keeps climbing, too.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.420
'Cause we played a ton of shows!

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.960
But we're not out of the woods yet.

00:15:21.960 --> 00:15:24.670
Are the two of you working on
your study guides?

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.540
Finished!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:30.290
Impressive!

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:31.710
Nah...

00:15:31.710 --> 00:15:33.670
You've earned a chocolate cornet!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:37.880
Preparation for exams appears to be
coming along smoothly...

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.130
Now all we need to do is focus on the prelims!

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.500
Look alive! It's crunch time!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:45.210
Yeah!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.170
PAREO.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.170
Is something the matter, CHU2-sama?

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.500
The remaining staging designs are complete.

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.170
Invite everyone over.

00:16:08.790 --> 00:16:10.750
Right now...?

00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:11.790
Hurry up!

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:16.630
My apologies. If I'm not mistaken,
the others are busy this evening...

00:16:16.630 --> 00:16:17.630
Busy?

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:21.500
They've volunteered to help out with
PoPiPa's show at Galaxy...

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.710
PoPiPa AGAIN...?

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.670
Three Weeks Live!

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:30.960
The first week flew by in the blink of an eye!

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.250
We've been performing at a bunch of
different venues every day,

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:38.380
and we've gotten to meet a ton of
new people along the way!

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:41.880
Let's go to the Budokan together!

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:43.580
Ready, and...!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.170
Po-pi-pa! Pi-po-pa!

00:16:46.170 --> 00:16:49.750
Po-pi-pa-pa-pi-po-pa!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.880
Thank you very much!

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:00.630
Hold on a sec, O-Tae!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.830
What's wrong?

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.580
Happy birthday!

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:11.500
Happy birthday!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:14.210
Happy birthday!

00:17:15.040 --> 00:17:16.460
Happy birthday!

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:17.790
Whose is it?

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.960
What?!

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.790
Come on! What's today's date?!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.920
December 4th...

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:23.710
Oh!

00:17:23.710 --> 00:17:25.210
It's mine!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.420
Happy birthday, me!

00:17:27.420 --> 00:17:29.290
Thanks, everyone!

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.080
Thanks, Mom!

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:32.540
Happy birthday!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.580
It's Oddie!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.960
How cute!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.790
This cake's amazing!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:45.330
Massu was the one who baked it.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:46.630
Massu...

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:49.040
It was Rei's idea to decorate it like Oddie, though.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:52.330
Thanks, you guys!

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:54.420
We've got presents to give you later.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.170
Really? Presents, too?

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.920
O-Tae, hold up your cake!

00:17:57.920 --> 00:17:59.080
Lemme get a picture!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:17:59.830
'Kay!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:04.380
CHU2's up next, right?

00:18:04.380 --> 00:18:06.750
I got plans for a HUGE strawberry cake.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:08.330
You're gonna love it.

00:18:09.210 --> 00:18:11.170
Rei! And you, Massu!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.210
Sure.

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.710
The rankings have been updated!

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:19.540
Already?!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.540
How'd we do?!

00:18:21.000 --> 00:18:24.080
As of now... PoPiPa's in 6th place!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.420
We did it!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.500
6th place!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:32.130
We're finally starting to catch up
with RAS and Roselia!

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:36.330
What's wrong?

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:38.750
RAS... dropped down to 2nd.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.960
Then that means...

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:57.500
"BanG Dream Girls Band Challenge!" Reaches a Fever

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:57.500
Pitch Roselia Blasts to the Top

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.710
Managed to turn things around on us, didn't they?

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:00.960
I'm not surprised.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:05.630
Callin' a meeting on such short notice,
CHU2 must be awfully mad...

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:08.130
More like pouting, if you ask me.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.880
Probably should've baked her a cake or somethin'...

00:19:10.880 --> 00:19:12.210
Not necessary.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.460
CHU2-san...

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.210
No problem. Don't worry yourselves.

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:20.920
I've figured out a way for us to make a comeback.

00:19:21.830 --> 00:19:22.960
And that is...?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:26.630
We're going to launch an attack of our own
on the other venues.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:27.830
An attack?!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.710
The competition is well-aware of our strength.

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:35.290
If we pick a fight with the other bands,
they're bound to withdraw.

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:37.540
No... we'll FORCE them to.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.290
Kinda brutal...

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:44.210
Furthermore, you are to obey
ALL of my orders from here on out.

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.000
Huh?

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:47.880
I will be taking complete control of your calendars.

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.580
Contact with the other bands is hereby prohibited.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.380
It's a waste of our time.

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.960
What's your problem?

00:19:54.960 --> 00:19:57.500
The schedule has already been laid out.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:02.750
In adherence to this schedule, each of you are to
cancel any work-related or personal plans.

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.380
Starting with tomorrow's performance,
we're getting serious.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.380
You must do everything necessary
in order to succeed.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:09.960
Is this some sort of joke?

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:11.580
This is WAR!

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:17.790
How petty...

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:18.710
Huh?

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.750
This is why we're gonna lose to Roselia.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:22.580
WHAT?! Like HELL we will!

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:24.710
We've already beaten them once, haven't we?!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.750
And if we fought them a second time,
we'd absolutely do it again!

00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:28.960
I'm not so sure...

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:30.540
What?

00:20:30.920 --> 00:20:32.330
What are you implying?

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:33.960
Nothing...

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.210
Nobody could win with a cowardly attitude like that!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.920
Don't you care about RAS at all?!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:41.830
And you two are just as bad!

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.750
Are you going to let RAS fail
after we've come this far?!

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:46.830
There's no time to prance around
at PoPiPa's concerts!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.580
There's no time for games!

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:52.250
If you aren't willing to commit,
then get out of my band!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:53.540
But...

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:54.830
C'mon, CHU2...

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:59.210
You dare defy me?! I am your PRODUCER!

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:05.290
Is that right?

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:09.000
Masuki-san?!

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.290
CHU2-sama...

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.210
CHU2-sama!

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:39.000
CHU2-sama.

00:21:39.710 --> 00:21:40.920
CHU2-sama...

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.830
I'm here. You can count on me.

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:46.710
No matter what, I'll always be by your side.

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:48.000
Shut up!

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.420
Being stuck with you is completely useless!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.250
Huh?

00:21:56.290 --> 00:22:08.210
What will you treasure when we
blast through the ceiling of our dreams?

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:12.500
La la la la la la...

00:22:12.670 --> 00:22:14.880
La la la la la la...

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.210
La la la la la la...

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:19.290
La la la...

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:24.000
Always laughing and joking as I chased after

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.460
Pieces of that faintly glowing dream

00:22:28.750 --> 00:22:33.420
I gathered them up and tried sticking them together

00:22:33.420 --> 00:22:38.710
To form a bright, shining star

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:43.670
Sparkling memories held tight to my chest

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:48.540
I smile fondly as I watch you take a step forward

00:22:48.540 --> 00:22:49.210
So I...

00:22:49.210 --> 00:22:53.920
Want to stay with you forever, more than anyone else

00:22:53.920 --> 00:22:58.670
Let's sing the rest together on the count of three

00:22:58.670 --> 00:23:02.330
I can't contain myself any longer...

00:23:02.330 --> 00:23:03.250
"Here we go!"

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:08.170
In the blue sky above, yes! BanG! Dream! (Blast through)

00:23:08.170 --> 00:23:13.000
A song of courage sways in the wind (Our dreams!)

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:22.250
Tying you to the stage of our dreams with its melody

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:38.380
Next Time: Vocalists are... Like Stars...
